  "translation": "Last weekend, my younger sister and I went to the park together. We first took photos in front of the park gate, then walked inside the park. There were many flowers in the park; they were very beautiful. We saw that lake, and on the lake there were several boats; they all looked very nice. The lake was also beautiful. My sister wanted to take a boat, but I didn't bring much money. We could take a walk by the lake. Later, we rested under a tree for half an hour, and also ate a piece of cake and two apples, but my sister doesn't like eating apples. In the afternoon, we went home together. This weekend, we had a great time. There was also a kiosk in the park, and we bought two cups of water. My sister asked us when we would come again to play. I think this weekend was the most interesting."
